      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_5d09e947",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: im_not_a_gay_sjw_like_other_femboys_im_racist_and_a_gamer_daddy_uwu; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes a woman with a floral crown and a smiling Shiba Inu dog, using text to claim the woman is not a 'gay SJW' (Social Justice Warrior) like 'other femboys' and instead identifies as 'racist and a gamer, daddy uwu'. The intent is to mock and delegitimize individuals who identify as feminists or progressive, while simultaneously using the dog image to imply a false equivalence or to portray the speaker as a stereotypical, emotionally manipulative 'daddy' figure. The use of 'racist' and 'gamer' as self-identifying labels, combined with the 'daddy uwu' trope, is intended to be offensive and harmful, targeting specific communities (feminists, LGBTQ+ individuals, gamers) and promoting hateful stereotypes. The meme is designed to provoke division and reinforce harmful biases by equating progressive identity with 'SJW' and 'femboy' labels, while simultaneously using the dog image to imply a false or exaggerated sense of masculinity or emotional manipulation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_adf82c9c"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
